mi>n</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</div></div>",
